@startuml
title Current implementation | Booking
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
[*] --> pending : bookClass; hold seat 15 min
pending --> confirmed : confirmAndEmit; outbox in same transaction
pending --> cancelled : expiry / class cancellation
confirmed --> cancelled : Teacher cancellation / no-show
note right of confirmed
 Confirmation precedes asynchronous wallet settlement.
 No Learner self-cancellation endpoint.
end note
note bottom of cancelled
 Confirmed cancellation emits refund trigger.
 Pending cancellation releases seat without refund.
end note
state "Declared domain states" as Declared {
 state completed
 state disputed
}
note right of Declared
 Declared in BOOKING_STATES.
 No transition handler to these states is claimed here.
 Class completion is a separate lifecycle.
end note
@enduml
